{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've got the brief. Let me summarize what I need to build:\n\n**OCTOM — team task management web app**. 6 frames, 1440 × 1024, desktop web, light mode:\n1. `01_Dashboard` — today's overview: stats, task done chart, tasks, today's schedule, messages, new task widget\n2. `02_Timeline` — gantt-style timeline\n3. `03_Task_Board` — kanban board + group chat\n4. `04_Files` — folders, recent files, storage\n5. `05_Settings` — profile form\n6. `06_Messages` — conversation list + Design Team chat + contact panel\n\nBrand color #5051F9, DM Sans font. Sidebar with icon navigation: Dashboard, Timeline, Task, Settings, Messages, Files (icon-only). Top bar with search, notifications (count 2), avatar, account menu.\n\nPrototype links:\n- From every frame: sidebar icons → other frames (Dashboard → 01, Timeline → 02, Task → 03, Settings → 05, Messages → 06, Files → 04)\n- From 01_Dashboard: a message row → 06_Messages\n\nNow let me read the Foundations page (1:2), Components (1:3), and Media (1:4). Let me call get_metadata on those in parallel.","signature":"31e7f6d59b3f47159325ecf8"}],"id":"ce5b6bb6-d291-4376-b720-a6220087b0a5","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0440d75-2a96-47fc-b3b2-8ce028ebb095","uuid":"1b02ce45-7fd7-4a88-8371-e0c8ced8bf4e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:29:05.970Z","thinking_duration_ms":5126}
