" + bubble with two photos (Photo_Chat_Design_1 150×110, Photo_Chat_Design_2 100×110 radius 8) + time.\n    - You (Dristin Watson) 10:30 AM right: brand bubble \"Great 🔥 That's a nice design idea. 😍👏\" + time. Avatar_Current_User 28 on right.\n    - Milie Nose 8:20 PM: \"Awesome 🔥\".\n    - Composer: pill input \"Add a comment...\" + icons right: Icon_Mic, Icon_Emoji, Icon_Image, Icon_Attachment inside field; send circle brand 40 with Icon_Send.\n  - Contact panel 300: card: header: Avatar_Killan_James 64, \"Killan James\" 16 bold, \"@killanjames\" 12 secondary; \"Attachments\" 14 medium + \"View all\" brand 12; 4 file rows: Icon_File in soft square 32, name 12 (truncate), \"7.5 MB · 3.22.22, 11:15 AM\" 10 secondary. \"Members\" 14 medium + \"+ Add Member\" brand 12 w/ plus; 4 member rows: avatar 36 + name 13 (Novita, Milie Nose, Ikhsan SD, Aditya).\n\nTotal width check: 380+24+560+24+300 = 1288 ✓.\n\nPrototype wiring:\n- Nav rail variants: icons → frames (component-level reactions).\n- Dashboard messages rows + \"Messages\" header → 06_Messages. Also stat cards? No — only listed links: sidebar icons; a message → 06_Messages.\n- Add reactions on rail icons inside each of the 6 variants (36 reaction sets, skip self? e.g., in variant current=Dashboard, Dashboard icon links to 01_Dashboard anyway — fine).\n\nAlso need \"current nav item\" state per screen: 6 variants handle it.\n\nEmoji rendering: text nodes with emoji chars — Figma renders emoji fine.\n\nSparkline in stat cards: small vector polyline.\n\nNow: the file is \"read-only reference\"? No — the user says the workspace copy is writable; reference pages must be preserved but 03 · Workspace is writable. I'm creating instances of reference components into workspace — allowed (\"Reuse the components in 02 · Components... use assets from 04 · Media\").\n\nInstance creation: comp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('6:43'); inst = comp.createInstance(); then append into frames on workspace page.\n\nOne more consideration: The workspace page 8:2 — screens at y=0: place at (0,0), (1600,0), (3200,0), (4800,0), (6400,0), (8000,0); components section at y=1250 maybe x=0. And label text nodes for sections.\n\nFont loading: await figma.loadFontAsync for each style used before setting characters. Styles: \"Regular\", \"Medium\", \"Bold\". Possibly \"SemiBold\" exists (DM Sans variable). I'll check available fonts in setup call.\n\nLet me now also double check data details I must include verbatim:\n\nDashboard:\n- Stats: \"Task Completed 08\", \"New Task 10\", \"Project Done 10\", change \"10+ more / 10+ more / 08+ more from last week\".\n- Task Done, Daily Weekly Monthly (current Monthly), y 0–400, months May–Apr.\n- Tasks: \"Task\" title. Task 1: \"Search Inspiration for project\", \"Start from 9.00 am\", inspiration.example.com, 8 comments, 24% complete. Task 2: \"Search Inspiration for project\", \"Start from 3.00 am\", moodboard.example.org, 5 comments, 60% complete. Note both tasks have the same title per data. Yes — data says Task 1 and Task 2 both \"Search Inspiration for project\". Keep verbatim.\n- Today's Schedule: \"Today's Schedule\", \"30 minute call with Client\", \"+ Invite\", \"Project Discovery Call\", 3 participant avatars + initials \"R\", timer \"28:35\", Icon_Phone.\n- Messages: 4 conversations as listed.\n- New Task: \"New Task\", Icon_More, \"Task Title\", \"Create new\", emojis 🎉 😍 😁 🔥 😘 😉 😎 👩 🙄, \"Add Collaborators\", Angela, Chris, Icon_Plus, Icon_Send.\n\nTimeline:\n- \"Timeline\", \"Today\", prev, \"June 20, 2022\", next, \"+ Invite\", team avatars with +5.\n- Day scale S 04 … S 21, 18 days.\n- 11 bars with labels and percents.\n- Phases with avatars + Icon_More.\n\nBoard:\n- \"🔥 Task\", avatars +6, Icon_Plus.\n- Columns: Backlog, To Do, In Progress, Review; Icon_More + Icon_Plus each.\n- 12 cards data as listed.\n- Members: \"Member (25)\", \"View All\".\n- Group Chat messages: \"Hello! 👋 · 08.00 am\", \"Hi, Everyone 🔥 · 08.01 am\", \"How are you? What did you