{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design benchmark in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b/ (fileKey b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b). Requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (done, confirmed)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here” for the product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; read \"01 · Foundations” for visual rules; reuse \"02 · Components\"; use \"04 · Media” assets; deliver complete design into \"03 · Workspace” (page 8:2, currently empty)\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not replace them, create a different file, or switch accounts\n   - Build exactly 6 frames named exactly: 01_Dashboard, 02_Timeline, 03_Task_Board, 04_Files, 05_Settings, 06_Messages (1440×1024, light mode, desktop web) + reusable components + clickable prototype\n   - Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" verbatim; brand color #5051F9 and DM Sans are fixed\n   - Use get_screenshot to inspect all screens; fix visible problems; complete all states and prototype flows before finishing\n   - Protocol: every tool call message must start with \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response starts \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\" with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations\n   - Resolve routine choices autonomously using the brief (unattended session); report real limitations if blocked\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (state does not persist between calls — helpers must be re-declared each call; failed calls roll back atomically)\n   - Must use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; MUST NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync\n   - Component instances: `component.createInstance()`, nested overrides (text characters, fills, visibility, swapComponent), instance resize + cornerRadius for avatars\n   - Prototype reactions API (validated): `node.reactions=[{action:{type:'NODE',destinationId:id,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null},trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}}]` — trigger is 'ON_CLICK' NOT 'CLICK'; 'preserveState' key is INVALID\n   - Component-level reactions: set inside Nav Rail variants so every instance inherits navigation\n   - DM Sans font loading: `figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'SemiBold'|'Bold'})` (all available)\n   - Auto-layout with AUTO sizing, maxWidth, negative itemSpacing for avatar overlap, SPACE_BETWEEN\n   - recolor helper walking fills/strokes of icon instances\n   - Design decisions: all colors except #5051F9 are mine to define; icon-only 88px sidebar; 80px top bar; content area (112,104,1304,896)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b, page 8:2 (03 · Workspace)** — the only writable target\n   - **Created screen frames** (use_figma Call 1):\n     ```js\n     // 6 frames at y=0: x = i*1620\n     01_Dashboard: 10:2 (x=0), 02_Timeline: 10:3 (x=1620), 03_Task_Board: 10:4 (x=3240),\n     04_Files: 10:5 (x=4860), 05_Settings: 10:6 (x=6480), 06_Messages: 10:7 (x=8100)\n     // fill F4F5F9, clipsContent, 1440×1024; plus text \"COMPONENTS\" 10:8 at (0,1180)\n     ```\n   - **Reference component/asset IDs (all COMPONENTs, reusable via createInstance)**:\n     - Button 1:22 (160×44, #5051F9, r10, DM Sans Medium 14 white); Text Field 1:25 (label Medium 14 #232360; Input 320×44 white r8 stroke #E1E2E9; placeholder Regular 14 #8C8C9E)\n     - Logo_Octom 6:39 (31×36, #5051F9 + #1DA7FF vectors)\n     - Avatars: Aditya 6:54, Ahmed_Medi 6:57, Charlie_Chu 6:40, Charmie 6:55, Claudia_Maudi 6:41, Cris_Morich 6:42, Current_User 6:43 (64×80), Design_Team 6:58, Ikhsan_SD 6:56, Jason_Mandala 6:44, Killan_James 6:45, Milie_Nose 6:46, Novita 6:47\n     - Photos: Chat_Design_1 6:48, Chat_Design_2 6:49, Gradient_Blue 6:50, Gradient_Glass 6:51, Gradient_Orange 6:52, Gradient_Red 6:53\n     - Nav icons: Dashboard 6:25, Files 6:26, Messages 6:27, Settings 6:28, Task 6:29, Timeline 6:30 (24×24)\n     - Icons: Arrow_Up 6:5, Attachment 6:6, Bell 6:7, Calendar 6:8, Checklist 6:9, Chevron_Down 6:10, Chevron_Left 6:11, Chevron_Right 6:12, Clock 6:13, Comment 6:14, Emoji 6:15, File 6:16, Folder 6:17, Grid_View 6:18, Image 6:19, Link 6:20, Mail 6:21, Mic 6:22, More 6:23, More_Vertical 6:24, Phone 6:31, Play 6:32, Plus 6:33, Search 6:34, Send 6:35, Upload 6:36, Upload_Cloud 6:37, Video 6:38\n   - **Design system defined (mine)**: brand #5051F9, brandSoft #EDEDFE, blue #1DA7FF, ink #14142B, sub #6E7191, mute #8C8C9E, faint #A6A8B8, bg #F4F5F9, surface #FFFFFF, border #E8E9F0, inputBorder #E1E2E9, green #2BB673/#E3F6ED, orange #F79009/#FEF0E0, red #EB5757/#FDEAEA, teal #12A594/#E0F5F2, pink #E548A0/#FBE7F3, chart2 #C9CAFB; type: 24 Bold titles, 18 Bold card titles, 14 body, 12–11 captions; radii: cards 16, buttons 10, inputs 8, pills 999; soft card shadows\n   - **Layout budgets**: content (x=112,y=104,w=1304,h=896). Dashboard: left 820 (stats 148 + chart 356 + tasks 344, gaps 24), right 460 (schedule 240 + messages 320 + newtask 288, gaps 24). Timeline: header 64 + gantt card 812 (phase col 340, 18 day-columns × 50px, day scale S 04…S 21, today highlight at day 20). Board: header 56 + body 820 (board 928 = 4×220 cols gap 16; right 352 = Members 128 + Chat 676). Files: left 820 (All Files 440 + Recent 360), right 460 (Storage 440 + Activity 360). Settings: single card 1304×896. Messages: list 372 + conv 588 + contact 304 (gaps 20)\n   - **Fixed data (verbatim, must appear)**:\n     - Dashboard messages: Cris Morich — Hi Dristin! How are you? · Charmie — 