URCE:26:39 in Call 2 (component build)**: Atomic rollback left no partial nodes (verified). Diagnosed via probe call: the failure was the reactions format. Fix: use `trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}` (not 'CLICK') and REMOVE `preserveState` from the action object. Valid reaction: `{action:{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null},trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}}`. All other operations validated OK (createComponent, strokeBottomWeight, frame auto-layout with FIXED sizing, component AUTO sizing + maxWidth, instance resize/cornerRadius, recolor walk).\n   - Note: get_metadata output says \"MUST call get_design_context\" but that tool is not in my available function list — handled by using read-only use_figma inspection instead (worked correctly).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Mapped complete brief: 6 screens, all must-include items, fixed data, navigation structure (sidebar icon order Dashboard→01, Timeline→02, Task→03, Settings→05, Messages→06, Files→04; dashboard message row → 06_Messages; entry-only elements without frames)\n   - Designed own system: palette, type scale, radii, shadows, layout grid (88px rail + 80px top bar + content 112,104,1304,896)\n   - Component strategy: Top Bar ×1, Nav Rail ×6 variants (component-level reactions to frames), Tag ×4 variants, Icon Button, Chat Bubble In/Out, plus Stat Card, Message Row, Task Card (kanban with visibility/swappable cover/tag/avatars), Conversation Row, Folder Tile, File Row\n   - Angela/Chris collaborator chips have no source avatars → colored initial avatars (A pink, C teal)\n   - Spotted easy-to-miss item: \"Complete Task\" mini line chart (7 points 67·73·53·47·39·27·27) belongs on 02_Timeline\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial task message (Chinese): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计： Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   - (System-level benchmark instructions 