de, placeholder \"write here...\" 13 mute at 44, send icon brand right.\n\nChat msg spacing: compute y cursor: after each msg, y+=bubble.height+26.\n\nLet me write. Also column headers: dot 8, title, count chip, plus icon.\n\nBoard body starts y=168 (header 104..168). Column x: 112, 348, 584, 820 (220+16 step=236). 112+3*236=820, ends 1040 ✓.\n\nColumn header y=168 h=32; cards start y=208.\n\nRight panel x=1064 w=352.\n\nMembers card: y=168 h=120: title (24,20) \"Member (25)\" 16 Bold; View All right (352-24-50,24) 12 brand; avatars 36 at y=64: 5 overlap 26: x=24,50,76,102,128.\n\nChat card: y=312 h=676 → 312+676=988 ✓ (board bottom 988, content bottom 1000, ok 12 spare — fine).\n\nWait 168+120=288, chat at 312 leaves 24 gap ✓.\n\nChat content height 676: title 20..44; msgs from 60; input at 676-60=616 h44 → y=616.\n\nMsgs: \nm1 In \"Hello! 👋\" t 08.00 am\nm2 Out \"Hi, Everyone 🔥\" t 08.01 am\nm3 In \"How are you? What did you do, everyone?\" t 08.03 am\nm4 In \"Good ✌\" t 08.05 am\nm5 In voice 1:25\n\nBubble maxWidth set 340 on comp — instance inherits; override width fine. For chat area w=352-48=304 → bubble max ~220. Set instance maxWidth? Instances: maxWidth override allowed. Set bi.maxWidth=220 before setting text? The comp already has maxWidth 340; override to 220. OK.\n\ny cursor: y=60. Each: avatar 28 at (24,y); bubble at (60,y) In; time at (60,y+bh+4) 10 mute. Out: bubble right: bx=352-24-bw; avatar (352-24-28,y) user avatar; time right-aligned.\nnext y = y+bh+26.\n\nEstimate heights: b1 ~36 (pad 10+13text+10=33→ round 36) ; total: 36+26+36+26+52+26+36+26+48 = ~312 → ends ~372 < 616 ✓.\n\nVoice bubble: frame 0,0 auto? Use fixed: w=200 h=44: play circle 32 at (6,6), \"Voice message\" 12 ink at (46,8), \"1:25\" 10 mute at (46,26)? or right. w: 46+90+... set w=180. r14 topLeft 4.\n\nTime labels: \"08.00 am\" etc.\n\nNow code it. Also plus icon top-right: frame 44×44 r12 fill EDEDFE with plus brand? Fixed just Icon_Plus — I'll do brand-soft bg + brand icon.\n\n