{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design benchmark in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b/ (fileKey b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b). Requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (DONE, confirmed earlier)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; read \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules; reuse \"02 · Components\"; use \"04 · Media\" assets; deliver complete design into \"03 · Workspace\" (page 8:2)\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not replace them, create a different file, or switch accounts/teams\n   - Build exactly 6 frames named exactly: 01_Dashboard, 02_Timeline, 03_Task_Board, 04_Files, 05_Settings, 06_Messages (1440×1024, light mode, desktop web) + reusable components + clickable prototype\n   - Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" verbatim; brand color #5051F9 and DM Sans are fixed; all other colors are mine to define\n   - Use get_screenshot to inspect all screens; fix visible problems; complete all states and prototype flows before finishing\n   - Protocol: every assistant message before a tool call must start with \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response starts \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\" with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices autonomously using the brief; report real limitations if blocked\n   - MUST NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync; must use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma; state does NOT persist between calls — all helpers re-declared each call\n   - **Reactions format (VALIDATED WORKING)**: `node.reactions=[{actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}],trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}}]` — `actions` is an ARRAY (new API); singular `action` rejected (\"Please update the `actions` field\"); trigger 'ON_CLICK' not 'CLICK'; no 'preserveState' key\n   - **Component IDs must be resolved**: `comps={logo:await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('6:39'),...}` — storing string IDs causes \"TypeError: not a function\" on `.createInstance()`\n   - Failed use_figma calls roll back atomically; per-statement try/catch guards allow partial commits + error localization\n   - **Vector normalization probe**: after setting `vectorPaths`, geometry normalizes to node bounds (test 'M 0 40 L 100 40' → height≈1) → position vector at `px+minX, py+minY`; `let px=0,py=0` must be declared before poly() uses them\n   - DM Sans styles: 'Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold' (all loadable)\n   - Emoji characters in text nodes render fine\n   - textTruncation='ENDING' with textAutoResize='HEIGHT' + resize for truncated previews\n   - Component-level reactions on nav buttons inside Nav Rail components → inherited by all instances\n   - Dashboard message rows linked directly to 10:7 (entry-only elements need no frames)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file b6HOXVpSd1U75KpjQDhJ6b, page 8:2 (03 · Workspace)** — only writable target\n   - **Created components (all on page 8:2)**:\n     - Top Bar: **16:6** (1352×80, search field 440×44, bell+badge \"2\", avatar, chevron; strokeBottomWeight 1) — avatar added in fix call\n     - Nav Rails (88×1024, logo+OCTOM.+6 nav buttons 48×48 r14, active #EDEDFE bg + #5051F9 icon): Dashboard **18:13**, Timeline **18:48**, Task **18:83**, Settings **18:118**, Messages **18:153**, Files **18:188**; each button has component-level ON_CLICK navigate reactions in order Dashboard→10:2, Timeline→10:3, Task→10:4, Settings→10:6, Messages→10:7, Files→10:5\n     - Tags: Design **16:26**, Research **16:28**, Planning **16:30**, Content **16:32** (auto-layout pills, fg/bg colors)\n     - Icon Button **16:34** (40×40, r12, F4F5F9, plus icon); Chat Bubble / In **16:37** (white, stroke, topLeftRadius 4, maxWidth 340); Chat Bubble / Out **16:39** (#5051F9, topRightRadius 4)\n   - **Built screens**:\n     - **01_Dashboard (10:2)** — DONE (10 children): rail 18:13 at (0,0), topbar at (88,0); 3 stat cards 260×108 at x=112/392/672 y=104 (Task Completed 08 checklist green E3F6ED/2BB673, New Task 10 file orange FEF0E0/F79009, Project Done 10 grid blue E7F5FF/1DA7FF, each with \"10+/10+/08+ more from last week\"); Task Done chart card (112,236,820,356) with tabs Daily/Weekly/Monthly (Monthly active, white pill at x=118 in 176×32 F4F5F9 container), y-grid 0–400, months May–Apr, series A [80,140,120,200,180,240,220,300,260,320,280,360] brand 2.5wt, series B [60,100,90,150,130,170,150,210,180,230,200,260] #C9CAFB, dots (last 12px white stroke 3); Tasks card (112,616,820,384) with 2 rows \"Search Inspiration for project\" (Start from 9.00 am / inspiration.example.com / 8 comments / 24%; Start from 3.00 am / moodboard.example.org / 5 comments / 60%), checkbox row1 checked brand, progress bars 724px; Today's Schedule card (956,104,460,240): \"30 minute call with Client\", 3 avatars (aditya/charmie/novita) + \"+ Invite\" pill, EDEDFE panel with \"Project Discovery Call\", avatars + R initial (orange), phone button, \"28:35\"; Messages card (956,368,460,320): 4 rows cris \"Cris Morich / Hi Dristin! How are you? / 09:41 AM\", charmie \"Do you need that design? / 09:12 AM\", jason \"What is the price of hourly... / 08:47 AM\", charlie \"Awesome design!! / Yesterday\" — each row `link(row,'10:7')`; New Task card (956,712,460,288): \"Task Title\" input, emoji row “🎉 😍 😁 🔥 😘 😉 😎 👩 🙄”, \"Add Collaborators\", chips Angela (pink E548A0 initial A) + Chris (teal 12A594 initial C) + plus icon, \"Create new\" brand button with send icon\n     - **02_Timeline (10:3)** — DONE (15 children): header \"Timeline\" 24 Bold; Today chip (780,104,80,44); chevron-left (884), \"June 20, 2022\" (908,120 wide center), chevron-right (1036); 4 avatars 32px (1088..1154) + \"+5\" circle (1178,32px EDEDFE); \"+ Invite\" brand button (1296,104,120,44); Gantt card (112,168,1304,648): gx=340, colw=53.5, today highlight col at index 16 (EDEDFE), 18 day labels wd=['S','S','M','T','W','T','F','S','S','M','T','W','T','F','S','S','M','T'] days 04–21 (day 16=\"M 20\" brand Medium), 7 phases × 11 tasks: UX Research (Profile 0,7,48% / Menu 2,6,54% / Settings 4,5,39%), Information Architecture (Login 0,6,48% / Services 3,7,54%), Build Wireframe (Testimonials 1,9,69%), User Interface Design (Menu 2,7,61% / Homepage 5,8,48%), Prototyping (Our Portfolio 3,8,63%), Development (Profile 5,7,48%), Front-End Development (Services 7,8,54%); phase rows h=36 (name 14 SemiBold + 2 avatars 20px + more-v), task rows h=30 (name 13 sub + brand bar h=10 r5 + white percent text); Complete Task card (112,840,1304,160): 7 points vals=[67,73,53,47,39,27,27] at x=240+i*170, cy=40+(73-v)*(90/46), brand polyline 2.5, value labels above dots, last point 10px white stroke 2 + brand \"27\" SemiBold\n   - **Working helper preamble (re-declare per call, current validated version)**:\n     ```js\n     const page=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     await Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:s})));\n     const hex=h=>{const n=parseInt(h,16);return{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};};\n     const solid=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\n     let px=0,py=0;\n     function txt(chars,size,style,color,opts={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(color,opts.o??1)];if(opts.center){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.center,t.height);t.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';}if(opts.right){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.right,t.height);t.textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT';}if(opts.trunc){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.trunc,t.height);t.textTruncation='ENDING';}return t;}\n     function frame(w,h,fill,opts={}){const f=figma.createFrame();f.resize(w,h);f.fills=fill===null?[]:[typeof fill==='string'?solid(fill):fill];if(opts.r!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=opts.r;if(opts.stroke){f.strokes=[solid(opts.stroke)];f.strokeWeight=opts.sw??1;}if(opts.name)f.name=opts.name;return f;}\n     const IC={'dashboard':'6:25','files':'6:26','messages':'6:27','settings':'6:28','task':'6:29','timeline':'6:30','arrow-up':'6:5','attachment':'6:6','bell':'6:7','calendar':'6:8','checklist':'6:9','chevron-down':'6:10','chevron-left':'6:11','chevron-right':'6:12','clock':'6:13','comment':'6:14','emoji':'6:15','file':'6:16','folder':'6:17','grid':'6:18','image':'6:19','link':'6:20','mail':'6:21','mic':'6:22','more':'6:23','more-v':'6:24','phone':'6:31','play':'6:32','plus':'6:33','search':'6:34','send':'6:35','upload':'6:36','upload-cloud':'6:37','video':'6:38'};\n     const AV={cris:'6:42',charmie:'6:55',jason:'6:44',charlie:'6:40',user:'6:43',team:'6:58',killan:'6:45',claudia:'6:41',novita:'6:47',milie:'6:46',ikhsan:'6:56',aditya:'6:54',ahmed:'6:57'};\n     const comps={};\n     for(const k in IC)comps[k]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(IC[k]);\n     for(const k in AV)comps['av_'+k]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(AV[k]);\n     function recolor(node,h){const s=solid(h);const walk=n=>{if('fills' in n&&Array.isArray(n.fills)&&n.fills.length&&n.fills[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.fills[0].visible!==false)n.fills=[s];if('strokes' in n&&Array.isArray(n.strokes)&&n.strokes.length&&n.strokes[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.strokes[0].visible!==false)n.strokes=[s];if('children' in n)n.children.forEach(walk);};walk(node);}\n     function mkIcon(key,size,color){const i=comps[key].createInstance();if(size&&size!==24)i.resize(size,size);if(color)recolor(i,color);return i;}\n     function avat(key,size){const i=comps['av_'+key].createInstance();i.resize(size,size);i.cornerRadius=size/2;return i;}\n     function link(node,dest){node.reactions=[{actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}],trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}}];}\n     function card(parent,x,y,w,h){const f=frame(w,h,'FFFFFF',{r:16,stroke:'E8E9F0'});f.x=x;f.y=y;f.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.08,g:0.08,b:0.17,a:0.04},offset:{x:0,y:8},radius:24,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];parent.appendChild(f);return f;}\n     function titleRow(f,text){const t=txt(text,18,'Bold','14142B');t.x=24;t.y=20;f.appendChild(t);const m=mkIcon('more-v',20,'6E7191');m.x=f.width-44;m.y=22;f.appendChild(m);return t;}\n     const tv=figma.createVector();tv.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONE',data:'M 0 40 L 100 40'}];const vnorm=Math.abs(tv.height-1)<3;tv.remove();\n     function poly(parent,pts,color,wgt){const v=figma.createVector();v.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONE',data:'M '+pts.map(p=>p[0].toFixed(1)+' '+p[1].toFixed(1)).join(' L ')}];v.strokes=[solid(color)];v.strokeWeight=wgt;v.strokeCap='ROUND';v.strokeJoin='ROUND';parent.appendChild(v);let minX=1e9,minY=1e9;for(const p of pts){minX=Math.min(minX,p[0]);minY=Math.min(minY,p[1]);}if(vnorm){v.x=px+minX;v.y=py+minY;}else{v.x=px;v.y=py;}return v;}\n     // screen skeleton per screen:\n     const scr=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:N');\n     scr.children.slice().forEach(c=>c.remove());\n     const rail=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('<railId>')).createInstance();rail.x=0;rail.y=0;scr.appendChild(rail);\n     const tbi=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('16:6')).createInstance();tbi.x=88;tbi.y=0;scr.appendChild(tbi);\n     ```\n   - **Design system (mine)**: brand #5051F9, brandSoft #EDEDFE, blue #1DA7FF, ink #14142B, sub #6E7191, mute #8C8C9E, bg #F4F5F9, surface #FFFFFF, border #E8E