{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"04_Files done (9 children). Now 05_Settings (10:6).\n\nLayout:\n- Rail 18:118, topbar\n- Single card (112,104,1304,896) r16\n- Cover: Gradient_Blue 6:50 instance resized to 1304×180 at top (0,0), clipped by card (cornerRadius clips? Figma clipsContent true by default for frames created — figma.createFrame() default clipsContent=true? Actually default is true for frames). Set cover at (0,0) w=1304 h=180.\n- Avatar user 88px circle at (48,140) with white 4px stroke border.\n- \"Settings\" 24 Bold at (48,248)? Cover 180 → below cover: avatar overlaps: avatar y=140, ends 228. Title \"Settings\" at (48,244). Buttons right: Cancel (white border) + Save (brand): at x=1304-24-64-12-88? Cancel w=88, Save w=88: Cancel x=1304-24-88-12-88=1092? Let: Save x=1304-24-88=1192, Cancel x=1192-12-88=1092. y=244 h=44.\n- Tabs row y=312: 8 tabs across width 1256: My details (active brand, underline) · Profile · Password · Team · Plan · Billing · Email · Notifications. Tab spacing: use flex positions: tab widths vary; place at x=48 + cumulative: text 14 Medium, gap 40. Active: brand color + underline bar 24×3 brand below? Or pill. I'll do: active text brand + underline rect w=tab width h=2 brand at y+8. Others sub color.\n  Tabs y=312; underline y=334. Then divider line full width y=352? Place divider at y=352 under tabs (E8E9F0... actually card inner divider F4F5F9? use E8E9F0).\n- Form 2-col: labels 13 Medium sub; inputs 470? Card w=1304, padding 48 → inner 1208. 2 cols gap 24 → col w=592. \n  Rows:\n  Row1: First name \"Dristin\" | Last name \"Watson\" — y=400\n  Row2: Email \"dristin.watson@example.com\" (mail icon right) | Role \"Product Designer\" (chevron-down right) — y=504\n  Row3: upload zone full width (592? or full 1208): \"Click to upload or drag and drop\" + \"SVG, PNG, JPG or GIF (max. 800x400px)\" — y=608, full width 1208 h=120 dashed border r12 centered content with upload-cloud icon.\n  Input: frame 592×48 r8 stroke E1E2E9 white; value text 14 ink at 16,15.\n  Label at y-28.\n  Avatar? The upload zone replaces photo upload. Good.\n\nAvatar overlap: avatar 88 at (48,136) → ends y=224; title y=244 ok.\n\nTabs: My details active. Compute positions manually:\ntexts: ['My details','Profile','Password','Team','Plan','Billing','Email','Notifications'] — cumulative x from 48, gap 40. Widths at 14 Medium: approx My details 68, Profile 46, Password 68, Team 40, Plan 32, Billing 44, Email 40, Notifications 88. xs: 48, 156, 242, 350, 430, 502, 586, 666. I'll compute via t.width after creation and advance.\n\nDivider y=356. Form starts y=400.\n\nRow3 upload zone: y=608 h=120: dashed? strokeDashPattern... frames support dashPattern via strokeDashes? In plugin API: node.dashPattern. Set strokeDashes? Property is `dashPattern`. For frame: f.strokes, f.strokeWeight=1, f.dashPattern=[6,6]. Supported on GeometryMixin: yes, dashPattern exists. Use it. bg F9FAFC or white. Icon upload-cloud 32 brand-soft? icon color brand at center top: center: icon at x=(1208-32)/2, y=24; \"Click to upload or drag and drop\" 14 Medium ink centered y=64 (with \"upload\" brand? keep simple all ink with brand on \"Click to upload\"); second line \"SVG, PNG, JPG or GIF (max. 800x400px)\" 12 mute centered y=88. Center via {center:1208} resize.\n\nTotal card h=896: y=608+120=728 + pad = fine.\n\nEmail input with mail icon right: icon at x=592-36.\nRole with chevron-down right.\n\nWrite it.","signature":"5d26bbdda62b4109afe5df56"}],"id":"1dc7c889-08e8-49f8-87d5-f094c643410f","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0440d75-2a96-47fc-b3b2-8ce028ebb095","uuid":"1555fb49-4f73-4fad-9ddd-5a2edda90161","timestamp":"2026-11-02T00:04:59.510Z","thinking_duration_ms":26584}
