{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Messages looks very good. Issues:\n1. **\"You\" out message header**: \"10:30You\" — the time text is overlapping the name. In my msg() out branch: nm is right-aligned with {right:476} then x=24 (resize to 476, right-align) — then tm: I created with {right:476} then set tm.x=500-tm.width AFTER appending, which breaks the right-alignment resize? Setting tm.x on a node that was resized to 476 wide with right-align — the text is right-aligned within its 476-wide box, so moving x moves the box. tm.x=500-tm.width makes box extend from 500-width to 500 → right edge at 500, but panel width is 588-24=564 → time right edge should be at 564. And name box: right edge at 24+476=500. Both end at 500 but should end at 564. Screenshot shows \"10:30You\" at around x~468 (in 588-panel scale ~690/1024*588≈396+24). The overlap: name right edge at 500, time box right edge at 500 — but time is single line and its width is ~40, box starts 460 — the right-aligned text inside sits at right edge 500, name \"You\" also ends at 500 → overlap!\n\n   Fix: name box right edge should be 564 (x=88, w=476 → 88+476=564). Time: right-aligned in box w=476 at x=88 too. Simplest: set both boxes: nm.x=88? I set nm.x=24 with width 476 → ends 500. Should be x=88 ends 564. Fix: nm.x=88, tm.x=564-tm.width.\n\n2. Out bubble: avatar at right ✓, bubble right-aligned ✓ \"Great 🔥 That's a nice design idea. 😍👏\" ✓.\n\n3. Photos: two design screenshots side by side ✓ (180×120 each, r12).\n\n4. Composer ✓ mic, placeholder, emoji/image/attachment icons, brand send circle ✓.\n\n5. Contact panel ✓ Killan James, @killanjames, 4 attachments with chips, View all, Members + Add Member, 4 members ✓.\n\n6. List ✓ PINNED (Killan Typing... brand + badge 2, Design Team, Ahmed Medi), ALL (Claudia Typing..., Novita badge 2, Milie badge 1, Ikhsan, Aditya) ✓.\n\n7. Header: Design Team avatar + name + \"60 members, 10 online\" + avatar stack + plus ✓.\n\nFixes needed overall:\nA. Messages: \"You\" name/time overlap → fix positions.\nB. Files: Upload button overflow (up.x 1352→1320; cnf.x 1148→1116).\nC. Files: Recent meta text overlaps more icon → shift meta left by 44.\nD. Files: Activity legend overlaps more icon → shift legend left.\nE. Dashboard: Monthly pill misplaced (empty pill at right of tabs) → reposition behind Monthly text.\n\nFor fixes I need node references. Options: search by properties. In fix call:\n- Dashboard 10:2: find the Task Done card → find white pill frame (fill FFFFFF r16 w176 h32) in tabs container. From build: tabs container at (24,64?) Actually earlier build: tabs container 176×32 at (24,64) with white pill at x=118. The pill is child of tabs container. Find: card named? I'll search scr.children for frames with width 176 height 32 → the tabs container; its white child → reposition to behind \"Monthly\" text: need Monthly text x within container. Monthly text is child of container too. Find text node with characters 'Monthly' → pill.x = mt.x-12, pill.y=mt.y-8? Text y within container: pill h=32, text h~18 → pill.y=0? Set pill.x=monthly.x-14, pill.y=monthly.y-7.\n  Wait actually is the empty pill I see the white pill? In screenshot at (~520,188) there's a white rounded rect. Tabs: Daily(112+) Weekly Monthly... the pill visible sits right of \"Monthly\" text. Original placement x=118 within container at card (24,?) — container at (24, 60?) in card coords... The screenshot shows pill after Monthly — because Monthly text is short. Fix by aligning to Monthly text.\n\n- Files 10:5: \n  - Upload button: frame w=96 h=44 r10 white stroke at x=1352 → set x=1320. \"+ Create New Folder\" frame w=192 at 1148 → x=1116.\n  - Recent card: child texts with fontSize 12 fill 8C8C9E at y matching rows → shift x by -44: for each text in rc where characters includes 'MB ·': t.x = t.x-44.\n  - Activity legend: dots and texts: shift all by -32: children created after title: texts 'Media','Photos','Docs' and 3 dots 8×8