tive: make nm left-positioned: nm.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT'? Can't change autoresize without resize... Actually can: nm.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT' then it shrinks to fit; then nm.x = 524-476... no.\n\nSimplest deterministic: \n- nm: set textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT' (now width ~26); nm.x=424; nm.y=y+2. (\"You\" at 424..450)\n- tm: set textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT'; tm.x=458; tm.y=y+4. (time 458..502)\n\nNeed the y of the You row. The You message row: name y = my position. I can find: nm 'You' fontSize 12 — its current y. Keep same y.\n\nFor Claudia m3 time: currently at x=521 (from bad fix). Fix: x=161 (68+85+8). But I need exact: find the Claudia name text on that row: texts 'Claudia Maudi' fontSize 12 — two of them (m3, m4). The m3 one is first (y smaller). tm target: x=68+nm3.width+8, y=nm3.y+2.\n\nLet me identify precisely:\n- You's time: the '10:30 AM' text with width 476 (resized) — unique.\n- You's name: 'You' fontSize 12 — unique.\n- Claudia m3 time: '10:30 AM' fontSize 10 with x>400 and width<100 → currently misplaced at 521. Find its row name: 'Claudia Maudi' fontSize 12 with smallest y (m3). Set tm.x = m3name.x + m3name.width + 8; tm.y = m3name.y + 2.\n\nApply.","signature":"9a9a6b5a168542f3bba81c97"}],"id":"962d22a5-cbca-4f0c-a957-6901549ee68a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0440d75-2a96-47fc-b3b2-8ce028ebb095","uuid":"ef998e33-6a13-4767-8f04-b0f1f071732f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T00:17:58.823Z","thinking_duration_ms":34781}
