labels Jan–Aug\n     - **05_Settings (10:6)** — DONE (3 children): rail 18:118 + topbar; card (112,104,1304,896): gr_blue cover 1304×180, user avatar 88px white 4px stroke (48,136), \"Settings\" 24 Bold (48,248), Cancel (1092,244,88×44) + Save (1192,244) buttons, 8 tabs starting (48,316) with \"My details\" active brand + underline, divider y=356; fields 592×48 r8: First name Dristin (48,400), Last name Watson (664,400), Email dristin.watson@example.com + mail icon (48,504), Role Product Designer + chevron-down (664,504); dashed upload zone (48,640,1208,120 F9FAFC dashPattern [6,6]) with upload-cloud 32 brand + \"Click to upload or drag and drop\" + \"SVG, PNG, JPG or GIF (max. 800x400px)\"\n     - **06_Messages (10:7)** — DONE (5 children): rail 18:153 + topbar; list card (112,104,372,896): \"Messages\" 18 Bold, search field (24,60,324,44 r22), PINNED label + rows y=152/224/296 (Killan James/Typing... brand/4:30 PM/badge 2; Design Team/Hello! Everyone/9:36 AM; Ahmed Medi/Wow really Cool 🔥/1:15 AM), ALL label y=388 + rows y=412..700 (Claudia Maudi/Typing.../4:30 PM; Novita/yah, nice design/4:30 PM/badge 2; Milie Nose/Awesome 🔥/8:20 PM/badge 1; Ikhsan SD/Voice message/yesterday; Aditya/publish now/yesterday); conversation card (504,104,588,896): header team avatar 44 + \"Design Team\" 16 Bold + \"60 members, 10 online\" + avatar stack (436/460/484, 28px) + plus circle 28 (512,28), divider y=84; messages: Killan 10:12 AM \"Hi, are you still a web designer?\" + \"Would love to see some designs 😁\" (in, bubbles maxWidth 400), divider \"Today, March 24\", Claudia 10:30 AM \"Hey, happy to hear from you. Yes, I will be back in a couple of days.\" + \"Here are some designs I took earlier today.\" + photos 6:48/6:49 180×120 r12 (68/260), You 10:30 AM out \"Great 🔥 That's a nice design idea. 😍👏\" (FIXED positions), Milie 8:20 PM \"Awesome 🔥\"; composer input (16,824,500,48 r24) mic + \"Add a comment...\" + emoji/image/attachment icons + send circle 48 brand (524,824); contact card (1112,104,304,896): killan avatar 64, \"Killan James\", \"@killanjames\", Attachments 4 rows (Very important file.figma purple / Some file.scratch orange / List of something.xd pink / Very important file.svg blue, each \"7.5 MB · 3.22.22, 11:15 AM\"), \"View all\", \"Members\" + \"+ Add Member\", member rows novita/milie/ikhsan/aditya\n   - **Working helper preamble (re-declare per call, validated)**:\n     ```js\n     const page=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     await Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:s})));\n     const hex=h=>{const n=parseInt(h,16);return{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};};\n     const solid=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\n     function txt(chars,size,style,color,opts={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(color,opts.o??1)];if(opts.center){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.center,t.height);t.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';}if(opts.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.w,t.height);}if(opts.right){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.right,t.height);t.textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT';}return t;}\n     function frame(w,h,fill,opts={}){const f=figma.createFrame();f.resize(w,h);f.fills=fill===null?[]:[typeof fill==='string'?solid(fill):fill];if(opts.r!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=opts.r;if(opts.stroke){f.strokes=[solid(opts.stroke)];f.strokeWeight=opts.sw??1;}if(opts.name)f.name=opts.name;return f;}\n     // IC/AV maps → comps[k]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)\n     function recolor(node,h){const s=solid(h);const walk=n=>{if('fills' in n&&Array.isArray(n.fills)&&n.fills.length&&n.fills[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.fills[0].visible!==false)n.fills=[s];if('strokes' in n&&Array.isArray(n.strokes)&&n.strokes.length&&n.strokes[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.strokes[0].visible!==false)n.strokes=[s];if('children' in n)n.children.forEach(walk);};walk(node);}\n     function mkIcon(key,size,color){const i=comps[key].createInstance();if(size&&size!==24)i.resize(size,size);if(color)recolor(i,color);return i;}\n     function avat(key,size){const i=comps['av_'+key].createInstance();i.resize(size,size);i.cornerRadius=size/2;return i;}\n     function card(parent,x,y,w,h){const f=frame(w,h,'FFFFFF',{r:16,stroke:'E8E9F0'});f.x=x;f.y=y;f.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.08,g:0.08,b:0.17,a:0.04},offset:{x:0,y:8},radius:24,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];parent.appendChild(f);return f;}\n     function setBubble(inst,chars){const t=inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT');t.characters=chars;return inst;}\n     // screen skeleton:\n     const scr=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:N');\n     scr.children.slice().forEach(c=>c.remove());\n     const rail=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('<railId>')).createInstance();rail.x=0;rail.y=0;scr.appendChild(rail);\n     const tbi=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('16:6')).createInstance();tbi.x=88;tbi.y=0;scr.appendChild(tbi);\n     ```\n   - **Design system**: brand #5051F9, brandSoft #EDEDFE, blue #1DA7FF, ink #14142B, sub #6E7191, mute #8C8C9E, bg #F4F5F9, surface #FFFFFF, border #E8E9F0, inputBorder #E1E2E9, green #2BB673/#E3F6ED, orange #F79009/#FEF0E0, teal #12A594/#E0F5F2, pink #E548A0/#FDE7F3, chart2 #C9CAFB; type: 24 Bold page titles, 18 Bold card titles, 14 body, 12–11 captions; radii cards 16/buttons 10/inputs 8/pills 999; card shadow rgba(20,20,43,0.04) y=8 blur=24; layout: 88px rail + 80px topbar + content x=112 y=104 w=1304 h=896\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Files Upload button overflow**: up at x=1352 w=96 → 1448>1440. Fix: up.x=1320, cnf.x=1116 (applied, verified)\n   - **Files Recent meta overlapped more icon**: meta text right-aligned to width-24 while more icon at width-52. Fix: shifted all 4 'MB ·' texts x-=44 (applied, verified)\n   - **Files Activity legend overlapped more icon**: legend right edge at width-24. Fix: shifted 3 dots + 3 tex